    <string name="privacy_technical">How this is enforced</string>
    <string name="privacy_technical_detail">This app does not request the INTERNET permission, so the operating system prevents any network connection. Those permissions are never added. A strict network security policy blocks cleartext traffic even if a permission were added by mistake.</string>
