    <string name="dev_explanation">Why this is true</string>
    <string name="dev_explanation_text">The absence of the INTERNET permission means the process cannot open a socket. Models are bundled in the APK under assets/models and loaded locally. Speech output uses the on-device TextToSpeech engine.</string>
